    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-07"
   },
   {
    "quote": "It’s all thanks to open source information and user-generated content. As chapters and case studies in this Handbook detail, this same material is being used by investigative journalists in Africa and by groups such as Amnesty International and WITNESS to expose fraud, document war crimes and to help the wrongly accused defend themselves in court.",
    "url": "https://datajournalism.com/read/handbook/verification-2/1-the-opportunity-for-using-open-source-information-and-user-generated-content-in-investigative-work",
